    <section id="about">
        <h2>About The Hunger Games</h2>
        <p>
            The Hunger Games is a popular book and movie series written by Suzanne Collins. The story takes place in Panem, a country ruled
            by the Capitol. Each year, children from the districts are chosen
            to compete in a dangerous competition called the Hunger Games.
        </p>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1448375240586-882707db888b"

             alt="A dark forest with tall trees">

    </section>

    <section id="characters">
        <h2>Favorite Characters</h2>
        <p>
            Katniss Everdeen is the main character of the series. She is brave,
            independent, and very good with a bow and arrow. Peeta Mellark is
            another important character who is kind and known as the bread boy.
            Gale Hawthorne is Katniss's longtime friend and he also takes good care of Katniss family.

        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="districts">

        <h2>The Districts and the Capitol</h2>
        <p>
            Panem is divided into twelve districts and the Capitol.
            Each district is responsible for producing different goods.
            The Capitol is wealthy and powerful, while many districts
            struggle to survive. The Hunger Games are used by the Capitol
            to maintain control over the districts.
        </p>

    </section>

